:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemies, see [[Mystic Mask Yulala]] and [[Spiritual Yulala (Enemy)]].''
'''Masked Yulala''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 6.7 Update|Version 6.7]]. He can be unlocked from the [[Catnip Challenges]] after beating the [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|40th Floor]] of the [[Heavenly Tower]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] increases health, decreases recharge time, deals massive damage against [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]], and is immune to Curse.

